'''N's hideout''' is an {{pkmn|animated series}}-exclusive location in the [[Unova]] [[region]]. It is located in a secret forest that appears to be in a separate dimension.
[[File:N's Hideout pond.png|thumb|left|220px|The pond behind the cottage]]
After {{an|N}} was injured trying to save Pokémon from Team Plasma's control device in ''[[BW117|Team Plasma's Pokémon Manipulation!]]'', [[Anthea and Concordia]] appeared from within a strange blanket of fog and rescued N from [[Team Plasma]], while {{Ash}}, {{an|Iris}}, and {{an|Cilan}} followed. They brought him to the hideout and healed him in a small pond nearby. Although Anthea and Concordia demanded Ash and his friends to leave, N permitted them to stay.

N revealed that he, Anthea, and Concordia took up residence in the secret cottage two years earlier after their [[N's Castle|previous home]] was destroyed by {{an|Reshiram}} when [[Ghetsis]] tried to control it. Since then, they have lived at the cottage, taking care of Pokémon who were injured due to the carelessness of humans.

The trio would later be forced to abandon the hideout once Team Plasma was able to locate it and attack in hopes of capturing N.

